Modifications made 2026-10-21 (see headers in each changed file):

  * Renamed packages and CLI (EscalateGPT -> IAM-Escalix);
    GPTClient -> LLMClient.
  * Split the hard-coded OpenAI client into a provider abstraction
    supporting any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (OpenCode, OpenRouter,
    Ollama, OpenAI); API keys are read from the environment instead of
    the command line.
  * Added an offline mode (cloud/fixture.py + --policies-file) that
    analyzes a stored IAM snapshot without cloud credentials.
  * Parsed model output and added JSON report output (--output).
  * Updated cloud/aws.py policy collection to key policies by user ARN
    with full documents inline (the original keyed customer-managed
    policies by policy ARN, losing user-policy association).
  * Made the Azure collector lazily imported (requires `adal`, an
    optional dependency).

